# 1 T44 NAND normalization/model, 2 T48b XLSX parser/model row writer,
# 3 T53 residual-model attempt, 4 T31/T32 decisive microstructure scoring,
# 5 fusion structured-file-only funnel, 6 HEPData official endpoint repair,
# 7 T34 all-tests output restoration is handled in run_all_tier_b fallback,
# 8 T50-T52 bound-only preservation, 9 near-confirm score dashboard.
